      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just finished my shift and i feel like i'm literally disappearing. every day is just scanning boxes, walking the same floor, seeing the same faces. it doesn't even matter if i'm there or not. the machine just keeps moving. i feel like i'm just a ghost in a system that doesn't even know i exist.",
